524 - 'Tis So Sweet to Trust in Jesus
 / 
Key: G
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 524
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[G]'Tis so sweet to trust [C]in Jesus, Just [G]to take him at his word;
[D/F#]Just to [Em]rest [D]upon [G]his promise, Just to [C]know, "Thus saith the [G]Lord."
[G]Jesus, Jesus, how [C]I trust him! How [G/D]I've proved [D]him o'er [G]and o'er!
[G]Jesus, Jesus, precious [D7]Jesus! [G/D]O [D]for [G]grace to trust him more!

Refrain:
[D/F#]Jesus, Jesus, [Em]how I [D]trust him!
[G]How I've proved him o'er and o'er!
[C]Jesus, Jesus, [G]precious [C]Jesus!
[G/D]O for grace [D7]to trust [G]him more!

Verse 2:
[G]O how sweet [C]to trust [G]in Jesus,
[D/F#]just [Em]to [G]trust his cleansing [C/G]blood;
[G]and in simple [C]faith [G/D]to [D]plunge [G]me
[G]neath the healing, cleansing flood!

Verse 3:
[G]Yes, 'tis sweet [C]to trust [G]in Jesus,
[D/F#]just [Em]from [G]sin and self [C]to cease;
[G]just from Jesus [C]simply [D]taking
[G]life and rest, [Em]and [G/D]joy and peace.

Verse 4:
[G]I'm so glad [C]I learned [G]to trust thee,
[D/F#]precious [G]Jesus, Savior, [C/G]friend;
[G]and I know [C]that thou [G/D]art [D]with [G]me,
[G]wilt be with [Em]me [G/D]to the end.
